    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTucked away in a discreet and highly sought-after setting just off Adelaide Road, 40 Leeson Place is an exceptional A2 rated, architect-designed three-storey mews residence, offering an enviable combination of contemporary design, generous proportions and unrivalled city living. Extending to approximately 202 sq.m. (2,175 sq.ft.), this superb home has been meticulously designed to create a sophisticated and light-filled living environment, all within a short 700-metre stroll of St. Stephen's Green.\n\nApproached through electric gates, the property benefits from secure off-street parking and enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and calm rarely found in such a central location. Beyond the entrance lies a beautifully crafted interior where thoughtful design and high-quality finishes combine to create a home of remarkable style and comfort.\n\nThe welcoming entrance hall sets the tone for the accommodation, leading to an impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen space that forms the heart of the home. This bright space is flooded with natural light and seamlessly connects with the gardens, creating an effortless indoor-outdoor flow. A guest WC and separate utility room provide additional convenience at this level. Upstairs, the accommodation comprises of four double bedrooms, each benefiting from its own ensuite.\n\nThe low maintenance town garden provides a tranquil outdoor area, perfect for al fresco dining and entertaining, while the secure gated parking further enhances the property's appeal.\n\nPositioned just off Adelaide Road, residents enjoy immediate access to an array of amenities including restaurants, cafés, cultural attractions and excellent transport links, all within walking distance. St. Stephen's Green, Grafton Street and Dublin's principal business districts are all close at hand.\n\nVisit the full walk through tour at: https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=6xSaKAgfAsB"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nwith oak floor, underfloor heating, cloaks cupboard, sunken mat, recessed lights and bespoke oak staircase.\n\nGuest WC: - \nfully tiled with wash hand basin with storage beneath, wc and recessed lights.\n\nOpen Plan Living / Dining / Kitchen - \n\n\nLiving / Dining Area: - \nwith oak floor, underfloor heating, recessed lights, contemporary electric fire and large sliding door to the front garden.\n\nKitchen: - \nbeautifully appointed bespoke kitchen with a range of fitted wall and floor units incorporating a larder press with folding doors, large waterfall island, Quooker boiling water tap, Miele dishwasher, Liebherr larder fridge, Liebherr larder freezer, Miele combi oven, Miele conventional oven, recessed lights, Silestone work surfaces and large wall mirror. Light floods in from a large roof light and sliding door to the garden.\n\nUtility Room: - \nwith fitted units, Silestone work surfaces, oak floor with underfloor heating, Bosch washing machine, Bosch dryer and large comms cupboard.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding: - \nwith oak floor, underfloor heating, recessed lights and large storage closet.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nlarge double room with oak floor, underfloor heating, recessed lights and extensive built-in wardrobes. This room also benefits from air conditioning.\n\nEnsuite: - \nfully tiled with bath, rainwater showerhead, large contemporary wash hand basin with storage beneath, wc, mirrored vanity cabinet, underfloor heating and recessed lights.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nlarge double room with wall to wall fitted wardrobes, oak floor with underfloor heating, recessed lights and sliding door to balcony. This room also benefits from air conditioning.\n\nEnsuite: - \nbeautifully tiled with step-in shower, rainwater showerhead, wash hand basin with storage beneath, mirrored vanity cabinet, wc, recessed lights and underfloor heating.\n\nSECOND FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding: - \nflooded with light from two large rooflights, oak floor, underfloor heating, recessed lights and large closet.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nlarge double room with wall to wall built-in wardrobes, oak floor with underfloor heating and recessed lights.\n\nEnsuite: - \nbeautifully tiled with walk-in shower, rainwater showerhead, wash hand basin with storage beneath, wc, recessed lights and underfloor heating. Velux to the front.\n\nBedroom 4: - \ndouble room with oak floor, underfloor heating, wall to wall built-in wardrobes and recessed lights.\n\nEnsuite: - \nbeautifully tiled with walk-in shower, rainwater showerhead, wash hand basin with storage beneath, wc, recessed lights and underfloor heating\n\n"
      },
